      "jp": "よいしょ……っと。\n結構ゴミや埃が溜まってるものなんですね……。",
      "jp_sha256": "20dd19c2d38c72fbad55f62f08cfed96ea9b89d364ec7499afd127a55b0e1314",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "영차…… 됐다.\n쓰레기랑 먼지가 꽤 쌓이는군요…….",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
